  Raises:
    TypeError: if elements of array `z` are not in (float32, float64).

  Notes:
  There is a different convention which defines Spence's function by the
  integral:

  .. math::
    \begin{equation}
    -\int_0^z \frac{\log(1 - t)}{t}dt
    \end{equation}

  This is our spence(1 - z).

